        "name": "USN-8063-2",
        "description": "USN-8063-1 fixed a vulnerability in Protocol Buffers. This update provides the corresponding update for Ubuntu 18.04 LTS and Ubuntu 20.04 LTS.  Original advisory details:   It was discovered that Protocol Buffers incorrectly handled recursion  when the Python google.protobuf.json_format.ParseDict() function is  being  used. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause  Protocol Buffers  to consume resources, resulting in a denial of  service.",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2026-0994"
        ]
      },
